{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign blko_sid = s.color_scheme.id | default: s.color_scheme | default: 'scheme-1'
-%}
{{ 'blko-ui-core.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'blko-collection-banner-73.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script data-blko-ui-gate>try{if(!new URLSearchParams(location.search).has('static')&&!navigator.webdriver&&!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)document.documentElement.classList.add('blko-ui-load')}catch(e){}</script>
<script src="{{ 'blko-ui-motion.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'blko-collection-banner-73.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
{%- render 'blko-fonts-balm', tokens: s.tokens -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Collection page opener, half of one idea with collection-grid-44 ("the shelf label and the case"): a paper shelf
  label in a double hairline frame is stuck over the left edge of a soft photo of the shelf (the back plane), and a sharp
  bottle photo (the front plane) stands in front, overhanging the shelf's foot. 12 columns: label 1-5, shelf 5-10,
  bottle 10-12. The label: number + label (+ collection name), kicker, h1 as a type combo (heading font + an <em> word
  in the light body face), lead, a hairline ledger (contents = the product count, then the merchant's lines) and the
  arrow link. 1024px+: the shelf stretches to the label's height; the bottle's foot and the caption share one baseline.
  Phones: label, then the photo pair, then the chips (they scroll inside their own box, 20px gutters).
  Rack focus (balm's signature, small form): on load the focus racks from the shelf to the bottle (html.blko-kit-balm
  only; bottle very soft and shelf near sharp at first, then they trade; the blur stays on the pictures inside crisp
  frames); a "Focus: Front / Back" switch under the photos racks it by hand (script.js; hidden without JS). Static and
  reduced motion: bottle sharp, shelf soft (the final frame).
  Reads the collection on a collection template (title, description, featured product image, collection image, product
  count); the settings override each one. Front: image, else the collection's featured image, else its image. Back:
  back image, else the collection image, else the front image.
  Sub-collection nav (hairline row under the banner): "Shop by shelf" small caps, then a round thumb, small-caps name
  and amber product count per sub-collection, no boxes; the current one gets aria-current="page", a thin ring and an
  amber underline. Below 1024px the row is a
  horizontally scrollable strip of hairline chips. Source: the "Sub-collection menu" (links to collections; reads
  link.object.featured_image and products_count), else the "Sub-collection" blocks (one collection picker each).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign c = collection
  if s.collection != blank
    assign c = s.collection
  endif
  assign count = c.products_count | default: s.preview_count
  assign front = s.image | default: c.featured_image | default: c.image
  assign back = s.image_back | default: c.image | default: front
  if s.heading != blank
    assign title = s.heading
  else
    assign title = c.title | escape
  endif
  assign text = s.text
  if text == blank and c.description != blank
    assign text = c.description | strip_html | truncatewords: 28
  endif
  assign lines = s.ledger | newline_to_br | split: '<br />'
-%}
{%- capture body -%}
  <div class="bcollectionbanner73__label-box"
    ><div class="bcollectionbanner73__label-in"
      ><p class="bcollectionbanner73__label bcollectionbanner73__muted bcollectionbanner73__split"
        ><span>{{ s.number | escape }}{% if s.number != blank and s.label != blank %} · {% endif %}{{ s.label | escape }}</span
        >{%- if s.show_name and c.title != blank -%}<span>{{ c.title | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
      </p
      ><div class="bcollectionbanner73__head"
        >{%- if s.kicker != blank -%}<span class="bcollectionbanner73__label bcollectionbanner73__muted">{{ s.kicker | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        <h1 class="bcollectionbanner73__h">{{ title }}</h1
        >{%- if text != blank -%}<p class="bcollectionbanner73__lead">{{ text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div
      ><dl class="bcollectionbanner73__ledger"
        >{%- if count != blank -%}<div class="bcollectionbanner73__lrow"><dt class="bcollectionbanner73__label bcollectionbanner73__muted">{{ 'blko.collection_banner_73.contents' | t }}</dt><dd>{{ count }} {{ s.count_label | escape }}</dd></div>{%- endif -%}
        {%- for l in lines -%}
          {%- assign kv = l | strip | split: ':' -%}
          {%- if kv.size > 1 -%}<div class="bcollectionbanner73__lrow"><dt class="bcollectionbanner73__label bcollectionbanner73__muted">{{ kv[0] | strip | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ kv[1] | strip | escape }}</dd></div>{%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </dl
      >{%- if s.link_label != blank -%}{%- render 'blko-ui-arrow-link', href: s.link, children: s.link_label -%}{%- endif -%}
    </div
  ></div
  ><figure class="bcollectionbanner73__fig" data-focus="front" data-fig
    ><div class="bcollectionbanner73__plane bcollectionbanner73__back"
      >{%- if back != blank -%}
        {{- back | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', widths: '600, 900, 1200', sizes: '(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 90vw', class: 'bcollectionbanner73__img' -}}
      {%- else -%}
        {{- 'lifestyle-2' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'bcollectionbanner73__img bcollectionbanner73__ph' -}}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div
    ><div class="bcollectionbanner73__plane bcollectionbanner73__front"
      ><div class="bcollectionbanner73__fmedia"
        >{%- if front != blank -%}
          {{- front | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', widths: '350, 500, 700', sizes: '(min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 50vw', class: 'bcollectionbanner73__img' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- 'product-3' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'bcollectionbanner73__img bcollectionbanner73__ph' -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div
    ></div
    ><figcaption class="bcollectionbanner73__label bcollectionbanner73__muted bcollectionbanner73__cap"
      >{%- if s.caption != blank -%}<span class="bcollectionbanner73__capt">{{ s.caption | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
      <span class="bcollectionbanner73__focus" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'blko.collection_banner_73.focus' | t | escape }}" hidden data-focus-ui
        ><span aria-hidden="true">{{ 'blko.collection_banner_73.focus' | t }}</span
        ><button type="button" class="bcollectionbanner73__label bcollectionbanner73__fbtn" aria-pressed="true" data-plane="front">{{ 'blko.collection_banner_73.front' | t }}</button
        ><button type="button" class="bcollectionbanner73__label bcollectionbanner73__fbtn" aria-pressed="false" data-plane="back">{{ 'blko.collection_banner_73.back' | t }}</button
      ></span
    ></figcaption
  ></figure
  >{%- liquid
    assign menu = s.menu
    assign use_menu = false
    if menu != blank and menu.links.size > 0
      assign use_menu = true
    endif
    assign subs = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'sub'
    assign t_count = 'blko.collection_banner_73.products' | t
  -%}
  {%- if use_menu or subs.size > 0 -%}
    <nav class="bcollectionbanner73__nav" aria-label="{{ 'blko.collection_banner_73.subnav' | t }}"
      >{%- if s.nav_label != blank -%}<p class="bcollectionbanner73__label bcollectionbanner73__muted bcollectionbanner73__navlabel">{{ s.nav_label | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <ul class="bcollectionbanner73__subs"
        >{%- if use_menu -%}
          {%- for link in menu.links -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign o = nil
              if link.type == 'collection_link'
                assign o = link.object
              endif
              assign cur = false
              if link.current or o != nil and c != blank and o.handle == c.handle
                assign cur = true
              endif
            -%}
            <li class="bcollectionbanner73__sub"
              ><a class="bcollectionbanner73__sublink{% if cur %} bcollectionbanner73__sublink--on{% endif %}" href="{{ link.url }}"{% if cur %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}
                ><span class="bcollectionbanner73__thumb"
                  >{%- if o != nil and o.featured_image != blank -%}
                    {{- o.featured_image | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '', widths: '64, 128, 160', sizes: '64px', class: 'bcollectionbanner73__timg' -}}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- capture ph -%}product-{{ forloop.index | modulo: 6 | plus: 1 }}{%- endcapture -%}
                    {{- ph | placeholder_svg_tag: 'bcollectionbanner73__timg bcollectionbanner73__ph' -}}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span
                ><span class="bcollectionbanner73__label bcollectionbanner73__subname">{{ link.title | escape }}{%- if s.show_count and o != nil -%}<span class="bcollectionbanner73__count">{{ o.products_count }}<span class="blko-ui-sr-only"> {{ t_count }}</span></span>{%- endif -%}</span
              ></a
            ></li
          >{%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- for b in subs -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign o = b.settings.collection
              assign nm = b.settings.title
              if nm == blank and o != blank
                assign nm = o.title
              endif
              assign href = '#'
              assign n = b.settings.preview_count
              if o != blank
                assign href = o.url
                assign n = o.products_count
              endif
              assign cur = false
              if o != blank and c != blank and o.handle == c.handle
                assign cur = true
              elsif o == blank and c == blank and forloop.first
                assign cur = true
              endif
            -%}
            <li class="bcollectionbanner73__sub" {{ b.shopify_attributes }}
              ><a class="bcollectionbanner73__sublink{% if cur %} bcollectionbanner73__sublink--on{% endif %}" href="{{ href }}"{% if cur %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}
                ><span class="bcollectionbanner73__thumb"
                  >{%- if o != blank and o.featured_image != blank -%}
                    {{- o.featured_image | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '', widths: '64, 128, 160', sizes: '64px', class: 'bcollectionbanner73__timg' -}}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- capture ph -%}product-{{ forloop.index | modulo: 6 | plus: 1 }}{%- endcapture -%}
                    {{- ph | placeholder_svg_tag: 'bcollectionbanner73__timg bcollectionbanner73__ph' -}}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span
                ><span class="bcollectionbanner73__label bcollectionbanner73__subname">{{ nm | escape }}{%- if s.show_count and n != blank -%}<span class="bcollectionbanner73__count">{{ n }}<span class="blko-ui-sr-only"> {{ t_count }}</span></span>{%- endif -%}</span
              ></a
            ></li
          >{%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </ul
    ></nav
  >{%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
<div class="bcollectionbanner73{%- if blko_sid != 'scheme-1' %} color-{{ blko_sid }} blko-scheme-pick{% endif %}" data-tokens="{{ s.tokens }}" style="--pt:{{ s.padding_top }}px;--pb:{{ s.padding_bottom }}px" data-bcollectionbanner73
  >{%- assign lbl = c.title | default: 'blko.collection_banner_73.label' -%}
  {%- render 'blko-ui-section', surface: 'bg', label: lbl, inner: 'bcollectionbanner73__in', children: body -%}
</div

>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Collection banner 73",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection",
      "info": "On a collection page the current collection is used."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "number",
      "label": "Label number",
      "default": "No. 01"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "label",
      "label": "Label",
      "default": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_name",
      "label": "Show collection name on the label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "count_label",
      "label": "Count label",
      "default": "formulas"
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "id": "preview_count",
      "label": "Count shown without a collection",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "kicker",
      "label": "Kicker",
      "default": "Small batch, since the kitchen table"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "info": "Defaults to the collection title. Italic words are set in the light body face.",
      "default": "The apothecary <em>shelf</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "info": "Defaults to the collection description.",
      "default": "Oils, serums, balms and bars, each with one clear job, mixed by hand and bottled in amber glass."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "ledger",
      "label": "Ledger lines",
      "info": "One per line, as Name: value. The product count comes first on its own.",
      "default": "Glass: Amber, UV-filtering\nShelves: 05"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "link_label",
      "label": "Link label",
      "default": "Browse the shelf"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "link",
      "label": "Link",
      "info": "Point it at the product grid below."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Photos (rack focus)"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Front image (in focus)",
      "info": "A single product. Defaults to the collection's featured image."
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_back",
      "label": "Back image (soft)",
      "info": "The shelf or the shop. Defaults to the collection image."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "caption",
      "label": "Caption",
      "default": "Pictured · amber glass, 30 ml"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Sub-collections"
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "menu",
      "label": "Sub-collection menu",
      "info": "Links that point to collections show the collection image and product count. Leave empty to use the Sub-collection blocks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "nav_label",
      "label": "Row label",
      "default": "Shop by shelf"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_count",
      "label": "Show product counts",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Style"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "tokens",
      "label": "Colors, fonts, corners",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "preset",
          "label": "Bundled preset (Balm)"
        },
        {
          "value": "theme",
          "label": "Read the theme's tokens"
        }
      ],
      "default": "preset",
      "info": "Reads the design tokens a Blocko theme sets (--blko-color-bg, --blko-font-heading, --blko-radius-card, --blko-theme-button-case…)."
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "info": "Repaints the section with a scheme from Theme settings > Colors. Works when Colors, fonts, corners reads the theme's tokens.",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 160,
      "step": 8,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 128,
      "info": "Phones use 70%."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 160,
      "step": 8,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 128
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "sub",
      "name": "Sub-collection",
      "limit": 10,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "collection",
          "id": "collection",
          "label": "Collection"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Name",
          "info": "Defaults to the collection title."
        },
        {
          "type": "number",
          "id": "preview_count",
          "label": "Count shown without a collection",
          "default": 3
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Collection banner 73",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "sub",
          "settings": {
            "title": "All",
            "preview_count": 12
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sub",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Face oils",
            "preview_count": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sub",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Serums",
            "preview_count": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sub",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Cleansers",
            "preview_count": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sub",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sets",
            "preview_count": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "class": "blko-bundle"
}
{% endschema %}
